			"type": "Line",
			"value": " The target rule holds whatever the target is built from — the base, and any computed",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 107
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " or call link along it, keep their own break points and become the only ones left. It",
			"start": 109,
			"end": 196
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " stops at the two spellings that are targets in the grammar but not in the clause.",
